      <description><![CDATA[<p>A simpler menu: the place, the time and weather, a compass and the painting style. Tap the time to pick the time of day and weather.</p>
<p>Pause, lock screen, view &amp; rendering and quit are in the "…" menu.</p>
<p>The compass turns the short way round, and the menu-bar icon is now a framed picture.</p>]]></description>
